            <div xml:id="m-6a665dfa-2439-43e6-bb54-500327217d24">
              <lg xml:id="m-9aa75f2e-67bc-4ccf-a73f-56e1367d071f">
                <l xml:id="m-ad8c6eb3-84b9-4be9-b586-99d8dc78fc68" facs="#m-df40edb7-42e6-4392-8438-b009509ad68c" label="ambiguous">904</l><l xml:id="m-99c1d45d-03a3-4ff0-9128-4bbc9ba01b5b" facs="#m-5b5fb293-ece6-4793-8afb-b16ec4da5b0a" label="ambiguous">Ember Saturday.</l><l xml:id="m-23b9cf6f-6c91-42a9-ba44-1f9c7513b753" facs="#m-742dd4d4-30ee-4b48-9d38-4fbcc77f5cd9" label="ambiguous">Lesson IV.</l><l xml:id="m-9bc1b730-0ae5-4431-8281-7ff1c0ec0fc1" facs="#m-335e4f46-63b0-4ab8-8f0f-d5aeeff29e25" label="ambiguous">Lectio libri Levitici. Levit. 26.</l><l xml:id="m-cb94fed1-7f0f-46bb-8bfa-e7729033d70b" facs="#m-61c7f838-715f-4aba-b55c-2d325eca6118" label="lyrics-like">N diébus illis : Dixit Dóminus ad ! términos vestros. Persequémini ini¬</l><l xml:id="m-03ba1dac-e142-4027-ba83-a1248e1a63c1" facs="#m-8e596257-173a-4853-8ac3-89fbac7a4844" label="lyrics-like">L Móysen: Lóquere filiis Israel, l micos vestros, et córruent coram</l><l xml:id="m-fe601511-1464-424e-aa83-7dd293ee8f61" facs="#m-16b432f9-eaa7-4cd3-90dc-143acbef9dfe" label="lyrics-like">vobis. Persequéntur quinque de ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-2ab0417c-8dfd-4d84-a7d4-23ac367e1a6e" facs="#m-12ed600a-5827-48db-b4ee-f02e8694999f" label="lyrics-like">et dices ad eos: Si in praecéptis</l><l xml:id="m-b1c98d74-e07c-4550-98b5-3ed6dd006290" facs="#m-d74bea9e-58f8-4427-897e-c2fd979c895b" label="lyrics-like">meis ambulavéritis, et mandáta</l><l xml:id="m-e9a89cc5-2497-4a1f-a0ee-74766df6583e" facs="#m-ac791084-b743-4fcd-af1a-01b03d4176fb" label="lyrics-like">stris centum aliénos, et centum de</l><l xml:id="m-95d461bf-ddab-4d2b-b249-2256972f0047" facs="#m-86e383b0-398d-436e-9968-0a650dcbc4a0" label="lyrics-like">mea custodiéritis, et fecéritis ea,</l><l xml:id="m-37fd507a-82d3-46ab-ae22-82344a29d4df" facs="#m-a8ee89e7-3c48-400e-8adc-a210e2e1131f" label="lyrics-like">vobis decem millia: cadent inimíci</l><l xml:id="m-01de3076-2310-4d79-a677-d27e94efd8bf" facs="#m-a8b544ea-1e20-4223-a5af-e79046e31397" label="lyrics-like">dabo vobis plúvias tempóribus suis,</l><l xml:id="m-aa52256e-7ce8-4518-8995-7281a2426937" facs="#m-4911191e-77d7-4795-b457-21f3dc5945f3" label="lyrics-like">vestri gládio in conspéctu vestro.</l><l xml:id="m-9d55fe8e-9342-4412-a1d8-4a4cf991d5cc" facs="#m-c7f2fee4-70b8-40c2-aad6-4ce116f7a1a8" label="lyrics-like">Respíciam vos, et créscere fáciam:</l><l xml:id="m-9dce176f-d86c-454f-b7d8-98bf4da0938c" facs="#m-e9a73d95-050b-459a-8b0d-b0aae3979c5c" label="ambiguous">et terra gignet germen suum, et</l><l xml:id="m-3984482b-2568-4805-9110-0b82039aa953" facs="#m-3f90483d-7c96-4132-a33e-d1562033c17a" label="lyrics-like">pomis árbores replebúntur. Appre¬</l><l xml:id="m-e0426805-38af-4236-8fd9-453c5638a35a" facs="#m-126b216c-017b-4c45-97fd-a7f6ff09e1ed" label="lyrics-like">multiplicabímini, et firmábo pactum</l><l xml:id="m-e15b37b5-1ff4-4f29-a98f-dbe44ff7b671" facs="#m-378f0d05-f27d-4668-8f82-11f697b5e2b5" label="lyrics-like">héndet méssium tritúra vindémiam,</l><l xml:id="m-6367a619-1901-474f-add1-cf67ce351cbd" facs="#m-09b8ff1c-5360-466d-ada6-d433e20c535b" label="lyrics-like">meum vobíscum. Comedétis vetu¬</l><l xml:id="m-5c4b1c99-fc3a-4fa2-82ff-8f53173c72d2" facs="#m-9dc3c0cf-5e7c-47a3-a844-4e192fb5d9aa" label="lyrics-like">et vindémia occupábit seméntem:</l><l xml:id="m-7e2de6de-26e9-491b-b5f4-3014f31a39db" facs="#m-d79d4b55-1600-497f-a0f9-e5b58f3e6c3e" label="lyrics-like">stíssima véterum, et vétera novis</l><l xml:id="m-c45bfca3-7ebc-49c7-b088-81663f891d40" facs="#m-b988bf8f-c042-420d-b218-11c937f9286f" label="lyrics-like">superveniéntibus projiciétis. Ponam</l><l xml:id="m-40fa5af8-64e7-4e39-b571-a384405287fc" facs="#m-20949456-4908-409f-ab32-492abc45da5d" label="lyrics-like">et comedétis panem vestrum in sa¬</l><l xml:id="m-984fd8f2-8af3-48f8-8e3e-934ebe9ce2b9" facs="#m-b8a4cc7e-f081-45f0-ab41-7d99354b7e7f" label="lyrics-like">turitáte, et absque pavóre habitá¬</l><l xml:id="m-b30c70b6-f51b-4bbe-bcbb-78a995cbe0da" facs="#m-063d2b1c-7d06-46d5-abf5-7e180e9f23e3" label="lyrics-like">tabernáculum meum in médio ve¬</l><l xml:id="m-2dd44dbb-17b2-4c69-93f0-4c7e384d1c96" facs="#m-fbb19b92-691e-4113-9484-9a914502c3e4" label="lyrics-like">stri, et non abjíciet vos ánima mea.</l><l xml:id="m-d749d637-465c-4f90-87a5-5dd29d695be3" facs="#m-6796ff22-cf0b-4888-af5f-1f10d58fad62" label="ambiguous">bitis in terra vestra. Dabo pacem in</l><l xml:id="m-2e3ad1d0-25ee-4626-8632-d4f4879aed62" facs="#m-678af69b-cf92-4f4e-be5b-bdcffd5addf2" label="lyrics-like">finibus vestris: dormiétis, et non</l><l xml:id="m-3df537b9-7890-43c8-b0eb-dbb67d8491da" facs="#m-a619b033-f282-405e-8e22-13fd52b7bd4c" label="lyrics-like">Ambulábo inter vos, et ero Deus</l><l xml:id="m-1bea83ae-6794-4604-a5e2-e93fc2eb815c" facs="#m-2453d780-ed03-437e-83c3-d829fab0928b" label="lyrics-like">erit qui extérreat. Auferam malas</l><l xml:id="m-4876d7e5-1f18-4135-802b-62d0d3d17420" facs="#m-17d5d233-9917-4038-95a5-cca22f8e2752" label="lyrics-like">vester, vosque éritis pópulus meus:</l><l xml:id="m-eecb8d11-12df-4efc-a551-8b79c600f407" facs="#m-2e579e8c-cd41-4269-9524-d8bf40a36d81" label="lyrics-like">béstias, et gládius non transibit! dicit Dóminus omnípotens.</l><l xml:id="m-42619d2b-f74f-44a2-baa8-1a7fab4c639f" facs="#m-3299d4c2-61ef-4cdd-bf9c-8866507e12e6" label="lyrics-like">Allelúia. Véni Sáncte Spíritus. p. 880.</l><l xml:id="m-88f7cef0-3776-4838-8d60-0168c1bbde53" facs="#m-06062811-d119-4203-8ab1-c212b11e47dc" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-da9bf442-9b96-4dbb-918e-da98f15648aa" facs="#m-4ec5d204-eb5e-48ef-adfd-bc81b2a7efd9" label="lyrics-like">DRaesta, quaésumus omnípotens tibus páriter jejunemus. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-be88bf4d-6e6c-46c1-aa3d-f1c562ad6f0e" facs="#m-ec1798f3-317b-497d-adfa-746b33c0c7d0" label="lyrics-like">L Deus: fsic nos ab épulis carná-] num.</l><l xml:id="m-fb30c2e6-6b80-452d-97c1-07562e2ed982" facs="#m-8bf0922f-f722-46bb-94f3-4edd6cca9e88" label="lyrics-like">ubus abstinére; * ut a vitiis irruén¬</l><l xml:id="m-c6a0ef0a-4969-4557-8764-6e3a2de3bfd6" facs="#m-86ed77ec-029c-48cc-9ad2-0b06a8710229" label="ambiguous">Lesson V.</l><l xml:id="m-bfee4301-f863-42ef-91ec-d569bfe0ef95" facs="#m-8e0821d4-f01e-4460-ae65-be65b63fd0e1" label="ambiguous">Lectio Danielis Prophetae. Dan. 3. e.</l><l xml:id="m-bacfd31a-f4ca-477f-9015-318225770e3f" facs="#m-afdf6b73-b8d2-4edb-aa9b-55934894db7b" label="lyrics-like">N diébus illis: Angelus Dómini( dit quos réperit iuxta fornácem de</l><l xml:id="m-90ad85a0-5f43-4e39-b82c-fd082f52e8e7" facs="#m-56de8f7f-a28b-465d-bd4c-a7bcb1a91b73" label="lyrics-like">I descéndit cum Azaria, et sócis Chaldaéis ministros regis, qui eam</l><l xml:id="m-727807b3-886a-4568-b18c-e2804cfec3ca" facs="#m-a7274420-5392-4428-a385-5612d62e44b1" label="lyrics-like">ejus in fornácem : et excússit flam¬</l><l xml:id="m-0d01715c-3b93-47dd-bb40-6ba5350696f0" facs="#m-cdccc126-be49-49c5-9c0d-0852dc346b10" label="lyrics-like">incendébant. Et non tétigit cos</l><l xml:id="m-195a4165-afeb-4686-bc00-a1b400e46441" facs="#m-102d37f9-e18e-419f-b756-a05f9913417f" label="lyrics-like">mam ignis de fornáce, et fecit</l><l xml:id="m-1fdc69c1-1597-410e-a8ee-9993ac77d48e" facs="#m-b2a42106-b525-411a-a52b-17667637e5ab" label="lyrics-like">omníno ignis, neque contristávit,</l><l xml:id="m-3f885354-40f2-4437-954a-8f5eb11647d7" facs="#m-c9410468-b560-40f7-a18d-46818b8a4b87" label="lyrics-like">nec quidquam moléstiae intulit-</l><l xml:id="m-3d43d95e-737b-4de4-a867-2afa69ed1d87" facs="#m-faff2440-a1bf-460f-b744-4d70e5572edb" label="lyrics-like">médium fornácis quasi ventum roris</l><l xml:id="m-a585042b-8c61-43dd-8483-b5a38333bcd9" facs="#m-f8579d80-22e3-4c4c-b929-de4caf50e483" label="ambiguous">flantem. Flamma autem effunde¬</l><l xml:id="m-a3ae841b-cf7d-47f5-bbce-323ae21bc26e" facs="#m-1b13cf40-ee7d-49aa-8338-a439dba05b38" label="ambiguous">Tunc hi tres quasi ex uno ore lau¬</l><l xml:id="m-77a42bc8-6609-447d-88c7-403d3d414ea7" facs="#m-cef99e38-965d-419a-933c-b9f93299fc99" label="lyrics-like">bátur super fornácem cúbitis qua¬</l><l xml:id="m-12854267-b723-4680-9836-d56da509d420" facs="#m-bdb7a9fb-dfff-429d-a8aa-581866677064" label="lyrics-like">dábant, et glorificábant, et benedi¬</l><l xml:id="m-c8e53aba-02d9-4288-bde9-0e4b8c98ca9b" facs="#m-dcf1cf1e-f2d1-472d-800c-9486bdcee5bf" label="lyrics-like">draginta novem: et erúpit, et incén¬cébant Deum in fornace, dicéntes:</l><l xml:id="m-e855af22-bc59-4ac1-a4a9-032282a028d6" facs="#m-fb5030be-0c82-42aa-a64d-46dcdff807a4" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-e568482a-7f0e-47db-b4b0-115a17601988" facs="#m-97439cdb-87e1-4330-88a6-a6bb3adfbb1a" label="lyrics-like">HHedó-a</l><l xml:id="m-13ad877f-40f3-427f-b7ff-9720655c3477" facs="#m-71aa658d-06ec-4384-a5a5-e5adf7ec14e3" label="lyrics-like">V. Be- nedíctus es,</l><l xml:id="m-e4a07bbc-5135-4620-8333-3807d0a39c01" facs="#m-29f28abc-23ee-4e97-bbfa-a97780fa2f8c" label="lyrics-like">Dómine Dé¬</l><l xml:id="m-49da5f06-9cb4-48c9-b8e3-964a02b21a21" facs="#m-8b3fca72-a771-4489-aafa-179edd6dde1b" label="lyrics-like">us pátrum nostró¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
